      "tweets": [
        {
          "id": "2114042708105060501",
          "text": "Of all the learning apps that my 4-year-old and I have tried, @once_reading is the only one that we’ve managed to persist in following for months. \n\nIt works because:\n\n1. It builds a habit where you need to learn with your kid daily\n\n2. It has lightweight gamification like taking a silly photo with your kid after every lesson\n\n3. After 30 lessons, Once will send you books for your kid to read by themselves, giving them a big feeling of accomplishment\n\nMy kid loves reading now and will even choose her Once books over YouTube and the phone (sometimes at least) which is the highest compliment 😅\n\nThis is not sponsored or anything I just love the product. \n\nTry out Once here: https://t.co/RbDiwACYbI",
